      "caption": "Quick quiz!",
      "s": 0.0,
      "e": 0.729
     },
     {
      "caption": "To find the average height of students in a college, you measure only the basketball team.",
      "s": 1.029,
      "e": 5.675
     },
     {
      "caption": "What's the problem?",
      "s": 6.025,
      "e": 6.993
     },
     {
      "caption": "It's biased!",
      "s": 12.693,
      "e": 13.457
     },
     {
      "caption": "Basketball players are taller than most students, so the average comes out too high.",
      "s": 13.807,
      "e": 18.263
     },
     {
      "caption": "Next, we'll see the surprising shape that sample means make.",
      "s": 18.663,
      "e": 21.891
     },
     {
      "caption": "Follow for data science made simple!",
      "s": 22.291,
